      "title": "A Service Quality Model and its Marketing Implications",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>Proposes to develop a service quality model, based on test of a sample of business executives, which describes how the quality of services is perceived by customers. Looks at its marketing implications, in which functional quality is seen to be a very important dimension of a perceived service. Concludes that quality dimensions are interrelated and that the importance of image should be recognised.</jats:p>",
